  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit casts it together with great thousand spears. Qin Bai Sheng defends with a huge pillar and a five clawed golden dragon coiling around it. The pillar stops the spears for a time, but white hair starts to appear on Qin Bai Sheng’s hair, and his lifespan shortens. Great thousand spears rain like a storm. The move is mysterious and hard to defend against. Lightning chaotic starfire mixes in, sneaking into the golden dragon pillar and burning Qin Bai Sheng’s flesh on contact.",
